    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Burning Chariot of Tzeentch.</strong> This warrior of Daemons of Chaos enters the field with a complete D&D 5e profile: armor, hit points, weapons, racial traits, and tactical maneuvers are all resolved directly from the embedded items on this actor. Its battlefield presence is practical rather than ornamental: auras name their radius, diseases name their saving throws, and maneuvers state their action economy.</p><p>Use the inventory as the creature’s tactical menu. Weapons list finished attack or saving throw text; features describe the exact condition, movement, advantage, damage, recharge, or aura they create.</p><blockquote><p>“The veil is thin, and hunger has learned to speak.”<br><em>— Be’lakor</em></p></blockquote><p><strong>Wargear and battlefield powers.</strong> This creature enters battle with Battlefield Doctrine, Daemon Claws, Hellblade, Warpflame Bolt, Ethereal Claws, Hooves and Wheels, Lance, Warp Talons, Dark Favor, Daemonic Instability, Whirlwind Sweep. Its drilled responses, charms, blades, and battlefield rites shape the rhythm of its turns.</p>",
